summary:
Two GT Interactive Computing faculty win awards at #ICML2024 !! Congrats to @judyfhoffman for the Test of Time award and @irrfaan for Best Paper!
Quoting @humphrey_shi
Congratulations to our @ICatGT colleagues for their achievements at @icmlconf!🎉
@irrfaan: Best Paper🏆 for VideoPoet with @GoogleDeepMind (including several GT alumni at Google Atlanta) and
@judyfhoffman: Test of Time🏅 for DeCAF!
More from GT this year:

🎤 Featuring a superb lineup of invited speakers and panelists:
